    "statement": "theorem continuous_cocycle_evaluation_certificate : CompactSpace ActualGalois ∧ DiscreteTopology ℤ ∧ (∀ x : AlgebraicClosure (ZMod 2),galoisAlgEquiv actualFrobenius x=x^2) ∧ (∀ σ z,trivialIntegerAction σ z=z) ∧ Continuous (fun p : ActualGalois × ℤ => trivialIntegerAction p.1 p.2) ∧ (∀ (c : C(ActualGalois,ℤ)), (∀ σ τ,c (σ*τ)=c σ+trivialIntegerAction σ (c τ)) → ∀ σ,c σ=0) ∧ (∀ c : IntegerCocycle,c=1) ∧ (∀ n : ℕ,0<n → n • (1:ℤ)≠0) ∧ missingIntegerClass≠1 ∧ (∀ σ : ActualGalois,¬Function.Surjective (evaluateCocycle σ)) ∧ (¬Function.Surjective (evaluateCocycle actualFrobenius)) ∧ (¬∃ (H : Type) (π : IntegerCocycle → H) (e : H ≃ IntegerCoinvariants), Function.Surjective π ∧ ∀ c,e (π c)=evaluateCocycle actualFrobenius c) ∧ (∃ c : Multiplicative ℤ →ₜ* Multiplicative ℤ,c (Multiplicative.ofAdd (1:ℤ))≠1)",
